"只影响状态栏剩余额度，与「显示卡片」无关。每项都是一个具体窗口：5h 是滚动的 5 小时窗口，周是本周配额。双额度按上面的顺序取前两项，单额度只显示剩得最少的那项。「符号」「圆点」两种样式会用沙漏标 5h、横块标周；其余样式只有数字，鼠标放到状态栏上能看到窗口全名。勾了但你的账号没有这个窗口，状态栏会跳过它；读数过期时照常显示上次的数字（变淡），窗口已重置、还没读到新数时显示「—」。" = "Only affects the remaining-quota readout in the menu bar, not “Show cards”. Each item is a specific window: 5h is a rolling 5-hour window, weekly is this week's quota. Dual quota takes the first two in the order above; single quota shows only the lowest remaining. “Symbol” and “Dot” styles mark 5h with an hourglass and weekly with a bar; other styles show numbers only—hover the menu bar for full window names. Checked items with no such window on your account are skipped; expired readings still show the last number (dimmed), and a window that has reset without a new reading shows “—”.";
