"默认关闭。开启后仅在 Claude Desktop 缓存不可用时，使用 Claude Code CLI 已有登录态向 Anthropic 查询 5h、周及模型额度，并缓存 5 分钟。登录 Token 只在内存中使用，不写入 Tokei 文件。" = "Off by default. When on, only if Claude Desktop cache is unavailable, Tokei uses Claude Code CLI's existing login session to query Anthropic for 5h, weekly and model quotas, cached for 5 min. Login tokens stay in memory and are never written to Tokei files.";
"默认关闭。开启后，Tokei 仅连接千问办公桌面端在本机 127.0.0.1 提供的受保护接口；千问办公可能随之向官方服务刷新额度。Tokei 不读取或保存登录凭据，需保持千问办公已登录并运行。" = "Off by default. When on, Tokei only connects to the guarded endpoint the QwenWork desktop app exposes on local 127.0.0.1; QwenWork may refresh quota from official services as a result. Tokei never reads or stores login credentials; keep QwenWork signed in and running.";
"默认只读 ~/.grok 本地日志，不访问网络" = "By default only reads local ~/.grok logs, no network access";
